---
// Process — three steps. #how-it-works anchor preserved.
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="how-it-works section" aria-label="Our process">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" data-scroll-reveal>
      <span class="section-tag">Our Process</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-cs-title>From idea to launch in <span class="gradient-text">three clear steps</span></h2>
      <p class="section-sub">A proven, transparent process that keeps you informed and in control at every stage.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-wrapper">
      <div class="steps-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="steps-grid">
        <div class="step-card" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="0">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <div class="step-icon-wrap">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Discover &amp; Strategise</h3>
          <p>We start by deeply understanding your business, goals, audience, and competition. Then we craft a tailored digital strategy with a clear roadmap before a single pixel is designed.</p>
          <ul class="step-list">
            <li>Business &amp; audience deep-dive</li>
            <li>Competitor analysis</li>
            <li>Scope &amp; project roadmap</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card step-card-accent" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="150">
          <div class="step-num">02</div>
          <div class="step-icon-wrap">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Design &amp; Build</h3>
          <p>Our team designs and develops your digital assets with obsessive attention to quality. You get regular updates, feedback rounds, and full transparency throughout the build phase.</p>
          <ul class="step-list">
            <li>Wireframes &amp; design mockups</li>
            <li>Iterative build with feedback</li>
            <li>Quality assurance &amp; testing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card" data-scroll-reveal data-delay="300">
          <div class="step-num">03</div>
          <div class="step-icon-wrap">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"></path><path d="M22 4 12 14.01l-3-3"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Launch &amp; Grow</h3>
          <p>We launch your project with care and continue supporting your growth — optimising performance, running marketing, and iterating on real data so results keep compounding.</p>
          <ul class="step-list">
            <li>Smooth, stress-free launch</li>
            <li>Ongoing optimisation</li>
            <li>Growth support &amp; reporting</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
